{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Escape source-less markers on non-persisted child failures.** For flat map/parallel branches and late children, this returns standard-invoke error data unchanged. If it begins `@aws-durable-payload:`, `translateException` immediately treats external text as an SDK envelope and aborts the invocation with `PayloadOffloadException`. Preserve it in a child-owned inline escape envelope without external I/O, retaining the disabled source policy, and add flat map/parallel regression coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7okNBM","finding_digest":"ba4a74928338a159747f8a50dfd05c4266054ca8969ef2a8a8c5b80e88b5130f","finding_id":"arf_v1_xjfhjeudhcqvs5d7rjin7uc4ij","finding_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::attachpayloadsource::external-invoke-envelope-marker-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::attachpayloadsource::external-invoke-envelope-marker-isolation","line":245,"observation_digest":"aa1d03fdfa1a9de23a6401871b2b0f224319000563bb27f4a39ba8ad391d166a","observation_id":"aro_v1_vioqh7p2dko6eoteagdrwkypej","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/SerializableDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_xjfhjeudhcqvs5d7rjin7uc4ij","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:34:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bnkytan6qbz2kkbfo5ofv5teg6","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"e9f3957eec87467c5d8566ed014a6e592000f653","reviewer":"codex","start_line":244,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_6afbzvvucuu2m6r3zytfax7cch","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:34:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
